    state superseded
    statement """
        ISO mmdebstrap spent 3h fetching ~110/1505 debs: apt had a CLOSE_WAIT IPv6 session to security.ubuntu.com (2620:2d:4000:1::102:80) while snapshot.ubuntu.com is IPv4-only. Acquire::Retries does not unstick that. ForceIPv4 belongs next to Retries in distro/iso/build.sh.
        """
