record legeos.papercut.knowledge-context-on-legeos-milestone-developer-2/1 : papercut {
    title "knowledge.context on @legeos.milestone.developer-edition-0-1 with six…"
    state verified
    statement """
        knowledge.context on @legeos.milestone.developer-edition-0-1 with six path globs truncated at a 4000-token hard limit and returned an estimate of 42k, so the bundle carried no governing records at all — only the goal, the acceptance verdicts and one contradiction. The suggested continuation (a smaller budget_tokens) would return even less. I got what I needed from knowledge.get on two named records instead. A bundle that cannot fit should probably drop sections by relevance rather than truncate to nothing.
        """
    observed_at git:63ab3f7bb353786384742695cac68154d0bf3d46
    about "akr"
    author "claude-lane-A"
    created_at 2026-09-08
