    title "On the installed TemplarOS laptop 'just deb' fails before building…"
    state verified
    statement """
        On the installed TemplarOS laptop 'just deb' fails before building anything: preview-codecs resolves path deps into ~/rust-projects/jpegXL-rs (absent; metadata runs --offline so it says 'no matching package jpeg-encoder'), and cargo-deb is not installed. Worked around by staging /usr/libexec/templar-preview-codecs into target/preview-codecs and cargo install cargo-deb.
        """
    observed_at git:50af3784cb5c3f0ebe72a1e15f12a88f57e11290
    author "claude"
    created_at 2026-10-01
